    "geometry": "Zero actual bare-body and stock trousers triangle/wooden-shaft intersections in valid windows",
    "native_pose": "Hip matrix/translation delta <1e-6; leg matrices unchanged; arm length delta <1e-5",
    "floor": "Actual post-render wheel lowest point remains .008 within 1e-5 model units",
    "gait": "Requested native Run/Sprint active; Sprint eligibility controlled; native feet move; cargo reduces speed; speed ramp starts/stops continuously",
    "diagnostics": "Require evidence probes/geometry analyzer; video or ALL_COMPLETE alone cannot establish these criteria"
